      "title": "Payload format does not define floating-point work",
      "observation": "Masks and sparse-attention metadata merges use integer predicates/indices. Memtest uses integer patterns and address/error bookkeeping; its intentional fault probe is outside the main init/move/check timer. Packed RGB median filtering is an eight-step integer binary-search approximation checked against rank median within one byte. Float32 matrix rotation/copy/transposes move payload bits and cannot inherit an ordinary scalar-FLOP denominator merely from their stored format.",
