      "title": "Force operators and trajectories have different timing scopes",
      "observation": "MCMD uses a common CABI host controller: its net timer includes CPU simulation/control, allocation and scientific transfers while subtracting instrumented input/output and host-state observation intervals. MD instead times force evaluation on three fixed geometries with independent pair-gradient and symmetry checks outside; MDH sums three vectorized screened-potential kernel means. These source boundaries support operator-specific interpretation, not a common full-trajectory or pure-device timing comparison.",
